  "overview": "**NutUI** is a light-first design system anchored on `#fff` canvas surfaces with `#0b0b0c` primary ink (19.7:1 contrast) and `#f82c45` brand accent.\n\nTypography centers cleanly on `System UI` (30px display down to 14px body), unified by `21px` base corner radius and stepped `#fff` -> `rgba(245, 245, 245, 1)` surface layering.\n\nMaintained by **JD.com**. Source: published token package, package `@nutui/nutui`. Inventory: **91** colors, **153** typography steps, and **40** documented components (MIT license).\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n- **Grid & Control Spacing**: Derived from 40 component tokens with documented paddings: `10px 25px`, `24px 20px`, `24px 30px`, `5px 18px`, `0`.\n- **Hierarchy**: Group controls cleanly within `rgba(245, 245, 245, 1)` cards; separate sibling sections using `rgba(204, 204, 204, 1)` hairlines rather than oversized whitespace.\n\n### Elevation & Depth\n- **Surface & Stroke Elevation**: Relies on crisp tonal contrast (`#fff` -> `rgba(245, 245, 245, 1)`) and `1px solid rgba(204, 204, 204, 1)` hairlines instead of heavy drop shadows.\n- **Interactive Lift**: Reserve higher surface brightness or focus outlines anchored on `#f82c45` for keyboard focus and active selection states.",
  "dos": "### Do\n- Anchor base views on `#fff` (light) with `#0b0b0c` primary text and `#808080` secondary labels.\n- Use `#f82c45` with `#f7f7f8` text (3.6:1) for primary CTAs, active tabs, and focus outlines.\n- Pair `System UI` headings with `System UI` body copy using documented weights and scale steps.\n- Apply `21px` base geometry across inputs and buttons (21px on outer containers).\n- Separate containers via `rgba(245, 245, 245, 1)` surface shifts and `rgba(204, 204, 204, 1)` hairlines cleanly.\n\n### Don't\n- Do not invert the base canvas out of light polarity without explicitly switching component text tokens.\n- Do not place low-contrast muted ink or raw white text on light accents without verifying >= 4.5:1 WCAG AA contrast.\n- Do not invent arbitrary brand colors, unverified fonts, or synthetic heavy shadows outside the palette above.\n- Do not mix conflicting corner radii that clash with the system's `21px` baseline.\n- Do not truncate or drop border contrast on `input` fields and secondary buttons."
}
